# Case 3: jennie.mp4 (1280x720 pillarboxed 4:3, 24 fps, 21.4 s) - one woman in a red slip dress (field, then indoors).
# Replace her with Giang (giang.jpg), who keeps her OWN outfit (olive-brown ruffled top, brown shorts).
# Paths are relative to this folder. Use ${VAR:-default} so command-line values win.
VIDEO=${VIDEO:-input/jennie_1080.mp4}   # 1920x1080, same edit as jennie.mp4 (528 frames)
CUTS=${CUTS:-37,163,180,206,247,260,269,291,439,472}   # auto missed 247/260/269/291 (dissolve, hand close-up, field->indoors)
CROP=${CROP-auto}                        # black side bars removed for generation, padded back at the end
# character sheet (utils/make_char_sheet.py, grid mode: front seed 7, sheet seed 23) from giang.jpg: panels 1 front,
# 2 three-quarter front, 3 side, 4 back, 5 three-quarter front, 6 three-quarter back + face-only close-up view_face.png
CHAR_REF=${CHAR_REF:-input/sheet/view_panel1.png}
CHAR_REF_EXTRA=${CHAR_REF_EXTRA-input/sheet/view_panel2.png input/sheet/view_panel3.png input/sheet/view_panel4.png input/sheet/view_panel5.png input/sheet/view_panel6.png}
CHAR_REF_FACE=${CHAR_REF_FACE-input/sheet/view_face.png input/giang_face.png}   # face-only view + face photo; only where a face is visible
CHAR_DETAILS=${CHAR_DETAILS:-"Female, slim build, round face, warm light skin, dark brown eyes, bright smile, long wavy black hair with a side part, sleeveless olive-brown ruffled top with a fabric rose at the neck, brown shorts, beige flat shoes"}
FACE_REFINE_REF=${FACE_REFINE_REF:-input/giang_face.png}   # real face photo, used when FACE_REFINE=1
KEEP_OUTFIT=${KEEP_OUTFIT:-0}            # she wears her own clothes
TARGET_TEXT=${TARGET_TEXT:-"the woman with long black hair in the red dress"}
PROTECT=${PROTECT-}                      # nobody else to keep
PRESENCE=${PRESENCE:-head}               # generate segments where her head is visible
# standard pipeline defaults (UPSCALE 1.5, scene colour, FaceRefine + guard) come from run_swap.sh
JOB=${JOB:-gen_720_scenecolor}; OUT=${OUT:-final_720_scenecolor}   # current best (Giang, own clothes)
# character sheet inputs (built first, reused): input/sheet_giang_own, KEEP_OUTFIT=1 (red dress) -> input/sheet_giang_outfit
SHEET_PERSON=${SHEET_PERSON:-input/giang_cutout.png}
SHEET_FACE=${SHEET_FACE:-input/giang_face.png}
OUTFIT_TEXT=${OUTFIT_TEXT:-红色真丝吊带连衣裙，细肩带，胸口蕾丝边，红色丝带颈圈}
